{
  "slug": "xpoz-social-intelligence",
  "name": "Xpoz Social Intelligence",
  "type": "plugin",
  "description": "Real-time social media analysis from Twitter/X and Instagram - brand sentiment, competitive intelligence, and influencer discovery",
  "longDescription": "Ships **4 skills**, **1 command** and **1 MCP server**.\n\n- **Skills** (4): `brand-competition` (Competitive intelligence analysis comparing a brand against competitors using XPOZ MCP), `brand-influencers` (Discover influencers and partnership opportunities for a brand using XPOZ MCP), `brand-snapshot` (Deep-dive brand intelligence analysis using XPOZ MCP), `polymarket-analyzer` (Analyze Polymarket prediction market events with real-time social intelligence from XPOZ MCP)\n- **Commands** (1): `pr-status`\n- **MCP servers** (1): `xpoz`\n\nInstalls with `claude plugin install xpoz-social-intelligence@claude-community` from `XPOZpublic/xpoz-claude-code-plugins`.",
  "compatibility": [
    "claude"
  ],
  "pluginType": "package",
